 RL    | m         | xyz  | C    | effective_radius_of_cloud_liquid_water_particles
 RI    | m         | xyz  | C    | effective_radius_of_cloud_ice_particles         
 RR    | m         | xyz  | C    | effective_radius_of_rain_particles              
 RS    | m         | xyz  | C    | effective_radius_of_snow_particles              
 RG    | m         | xyz  | C    | effective_radius_of_graupel_particles           
 OX    | mol mol-1 | xyz  | C    | odd-oxygen_volume_mixing_ratio                  
 FCLD  | 1         | xyz  | C    | cloud_area_fraction                             
 ALBVR | 1         | xy   | N    | surface_albedo_for_visible_beam                 
 ALBVF | 1         | xy   | N    | surface_albedo_for_visible_diffuse              
 ALBNR | 1         | xy   | N    | surface_albedo_for_near_infrared_beam           
 ALBNF | 1         | xy   | N    | surface_albedo_for_near_infrared_diffuse        
 PREF  | Pa        | z    | E    | reference_air_pressure                          

