# The following ADD2EXPORT INTERNALs (through FORINUMTTPAR) are really EXPORTs.
# As of 5/2022 MAPL only re-loads IMPORTs/INTERNALs at the start of the replay
# Corrector phase, not EXPORTs, so intermittent EXPORTs (such as these solar
# REFRESH exports) would otherwise show stale Predictor-phase values. Making
# them ADD2EXPORT INTERNALs ensures they are reloaded and time-synced
# correctly, at the cost of INTERNAL storage even when not requested.
#
# COSZSW is the flux-weighted, time-averaged value over the REFRESH
# interval; use it for sub-sampling/analysing REFRESH diagnostics like
# CLDxxSW (e.g. subsample both with COSZSW >= cmin, e.g. 0.25, for a fair
# apples-to-apples comparison against heartbeat-frequency CLDxx).
 COSZSW         | 1     | xy   | N    |                       | .TRUE.     |            |                  | cosine_of_the_solar_zenith_angle_of_Solar_REFRESH                                                     
# The four CLDxxSW diagnostics represent super-layer cloud fractions based
# on the subcolumn cloud generation called in RRTMG[P] SW. They are sunlit
# only and generated only at the SW REFRESH frequency, NOT at the heartbeat.
# Useful for diagnostic comparisons with the heartbeat-frequency CLDxx set,
# but should NOT be used to subsample heartbeat-frequency fields.
 CLDTTSW        | 1     | xy   | N    |                       | .TRUE.     |            |                  | total_cloud_area_fraction_RRTMG_P_SW_REFRESH                                                          
 CLDHISW        | 1     | xy   | N    |                       | .TRUE.     |            |                  | high-level_cloud_area_fraction_RRTMG_P_SW_REFRESH                                                     
 CLDMDSW        | 1     | xy   | N    |                       | .TRUE.     |            |                  | mid-level_cloud_area_fraction_RRTMG_P_SW_REFRESH                                                      
 CLDLOSW        | 1     | xy   | N    |                       | .TRUE.     |            |                  | low-level_cloud_area_fraction_RRTMG_P_SW_REFRESH                                                      
# The following TAUxxPAR and COTxxPAR are REFRESH-frequency fields; the
# CLDxxSW provisos above apply to these too. Their advantage is that they
# use the subcolumn cloud generation called in RRTMG[P].
#
# TAUxxPAR are ZERO for clear super-layers, an anti-pattern for *in-cloud*
# optical thicknesses, and deprecated (reserved for developer usage, see
# TAULOPAR etc. below, COND=USE_SOLAR_RADVAL). They may later be removed.
#
# COTxxPAR are UNDEF for clear super-layers, whereas TAUxxPAR are ZERO, so
# COTxxPAR are a better in-cloud diagnostic.
#
# COT[DEN|NUM]xxPAR allow a true cloud-fraction-weighted in-cloud optical
# thickness via COTNUMxxPAR / COTDENxxPAR (see comments under COT[DEN|NUM]xx
# in the EXPORT category below).
#
# COTDS[DEN|NUM]xxPAR are like COT[DEN|NUM]xxPAR but delta-scaled.
#
# COTDS[DEN|NUM]xx, COTL[DEN|NUM]xx, COTLDS[DEN|NUM]xx, COTI[DEN|NUM]xx,
# COTIDS[DEN|NUM]xx, SSAL/SSAI/ASML/ASMI [DEN|NUM]xx (and their delta-scaled
# variants), and FORL/FORI [DEN|NUM]xx PAR fields below are all gated with
# COND=USE_SOLAR_RADVAL.
 COTLOPAR       | 1     | xy   | N    |                       | .TRUE.     |            |                  | in_cloud_optical_thickness_of_low_clouds_RRTMG_P_PAR_REFRESH_clrundef                                 
 COTMDPAR       | 1     | xy   | N    |                       | .TRUE.     |            |                  | in_cloud_optical_thickness_of_middle_clouds_RRTMG_P_PAR_REFRESH_clrundef                              
 COTHIPAR       | 1     | xy   | N    |                       | .TRUE.     |            |                  | in_cloud_optical_thickness_of_high_clouds_RRTMG_P_PAR_REFRESH_clrundef                                
 COTTTPAR       | 1     | xy   | N    |                       | .TRUE.     |            |                  | in_cloud_optical_thickness_of_all_clouds_RRTMG_P_PAR_REFRESH_clrundef                                 
 COTDENLOPAR    | 1     | xy   | N    |                       | .TRUE.     |            |                  | in_cloud_optical_thickness_of_low_clouds_RRTMG_P_PAR_REFRESH_denominator                              
 COTDENMDPAR    | 1     | xy   | N    |                       | .TRUE.     |            |                  | in_cloud_optical_thickness_of_middle_clouds_RRTMG_P_PAR_REFRESH_denominator                           
 COTDENHIPAR    | 1     | xy   | N    |                       | .TRUE.     |            |                  | in_cloud_optical_thickness_of_high_clouds_RRTMG_P_PAR_REFRESH_denominator                             
 COTDENTTPAR    | 1     | xy   | N    |                       | .TRUE.     |            |                  | in_cloud_optical_thickness_of_all_clouds_RRTMG_P_PAR_REFRESH_denominator                              
 COTNUMLOPAR    | 1     | xy   | N    |                       | .TRUE.     |            |                  | in_cloud_optical_thickness_of_low_clouds_RRTMG_P_PAR_REFRESH_numerator                                
 COTNUMMDPAR    | 1     | xy   | N    |                       | .TRUE.     |            |                  | in_cloud_optical_thickness_of_middle_clouds_RRTMG_P_PAR_REFRESH_numerator                             
 COTNUMHIPAR    | 1     | xy   | N    |                       | .TRUE.     |            |                  | in_cloud_optical_thickness_of_high_clouds_RRTMG_P_PAR_REFRESH_numerator                               
