 COTDSDENMDPAR  | 1     | xy   | N    |                       | .TRUE.     |            | USE_SOLAR_RADVAL | in_cloud_optical_thickness_delta_scaled_of_middle_clouds_RRTMG_P_PAR_REFRESH_denominator              
